  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.serveratelier.com%252f/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.serveratelier.com/assets/themes/atelier/assets/images/banner/sa_budget.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"6664\" height=\"917\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Axu42vQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"176\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/K0Bn3Mh.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"27\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">NumismaticClaim是NumismaticOverhaul和OPAC之间的兼容模组。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">它允许从特定村民处购买额外领土。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Yx7Ye7m.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"504\" height=\"498\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oCrtfsy.gifv\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WKCuHQL.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"34\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ol1Tcf8.png\" alt=\"fabric-api\" width=\"125\" height=\"42\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7weZ8uu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"125\" height=\"42\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此模组专为Fabric开发。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">暂无Forge版本的开发计划。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Modpack授权：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可自由用于任何Modpack</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">问题反馈：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">请在GitHub页面提交漏洞报告</span></p>",
